    },
    {
      "author_id": "1974653328274714624",
      "created_at": "2026-11-15T02:26:08.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2121791831830602040"
      ],
      "id": "2121791831830602040",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1974653328274714624",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 1,
        "impression_count": 188,
        "like_count": 0,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 0,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2121791822452109390",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "顺便说一句，这套事件收件箱加定时器的解耦思路，哪怕你不用 Claude 的官方框架，拿 Python 配合 SQLite 或者 Redis 也能在一个下午之内手搓出来，核心是千万别让大模型自己去管理并发和睡眠时钟。\n🔗 https://t.co/phRXR0RBe7",
      "url": "https://x.com/AYi_AInotes/status/2121791831830602040"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1974653328274714624",
      "created_at": "2026-11-15T02:26:06.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2121791822452109390"
      ],
      "id": "2121791822452109390",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1974653328274714624",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 203,
        "like_count": 1,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2121791816106221861",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "这 5 个组件里我最喜欢的就是梦境整理这个设计，简直跟人类大脑一模一样，白天醒着的时候只管干活记流水账，等半夜闲下来了自动做一次复盘清理，把没用的噪音删掉、把核心结论归档，不然再大的上下文窗口跑上一个月也会被垃圾记忆彻底撑爆。",
      "url": "https://x.com/AYi_AInotes/status/2121791822452109390"
    }
  ],
